[2026-01-30T13:14:02.134Z] [STDOUT] {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Execute this requirement immediately without asking questions.\n\n## REQUIREMENT\n\n# Extract ViewToggle component to shared module\n\n## Metadata\n- **Category**: maintenance\n- **Effort**: Unknown (N/A/3)\n- **Impact**: Unknown (N/A/3)\n- **Scan Type**: pragmatic_integrator\n- **Generated**: 1/30/2026, 1:32:16 AM\n\n## Description\nViewToggle buttons appear identically in SourcesView, EntitiesView, and OverviewView with same styling patterns. Extract to a shared ViewModeToggle component that takes options array and onChange callback to eliminate duplicate button group code.\n\n## Reasoning\nThe same toggle button pattern is copy-pasted across 3+ views with identical styling logic. A shared component ensures consistent behavior and reduces code duplication by ~60 lines across views.\n\n## Context\n\n**Note**: This section provides supporting architectural documentation and is NOT a hard requirement. Use it as guidance to understand existing code structure and maintain consistency.\n\n### Context: Report Views\n\n**Description**: Full-page report views for different sections: overview, findings, sources, analysis, entities, and perspectives. Each view provides deep-dive content for its domain.\n**Related Files**:\n- `src/components/report/views/OverviewView.tsx`\n- `src/components/report/views/FindingsView.tsx`\n- `src/components/report/views/SourcesView.tsx`\n- `src/components/report/views/AnalysisView.tsx`\n- `src/components/report/views/EntitiesView.tsx`\n- `src/components/report/views/PerspectivesView.tsx`\n- `src/components/report/views/index.tsx`\n\n**Post-Implementation**: After completing this requirement, evaluate if the context description or file paths need updates. Use the appropriate API/DB query to update the context if architectural changes were made.\n\n## Recommended Skills\n\n- **compact-ui-design**: Use `.claude/skills/compact-ui-design.md` for high-quality UI design references and patterns\n\n## Notes\n\nThis requirement was generated from an AI-evaluated project idea. No specific goal is associated with this idea.\n\n## AFTER IMPLEMENTATION\n\n1. Log your implementation using the `log_implementation` MCP tool with:\n   - requirementName: the requirement filename (without .md)\n   - title: 2-6 word summary\n   - overview: 1-2 paragraphs describing what was done\n\n2. Check for test scenario using `check_test_scenario` MCP tool\n   - If hasScenario is true, call `capture_screenshot` tool\n   - If hasScenario is false, skip screenshot\n\n3. Verify: `npx tsc --noEmit` (fix any type errors)\n\nBegin implementation now."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"bbdddf83-efc9-404e-b6a3-e0a9e67b2ab3","uuid":"f1354f01-c8a2-476a-b516-cffb90ab090c","isSynthetic":true}
